HOW IT'S MADE
-------------

- Install Dart (using 'winget', for example), or download Dart SDK archive (it can be used without installation).

- To check the version:

    > dart info

- To find out-of-date dependencies:

    > dart pub outdated

- To upgrade dependencies:

    > dart pub upgrade

- If required, edit "RegExpWorker.dart".

- Run

    > build.cmd

    It will create "regexpworker.exe".

- Run "testXXX.cmd" to perform simple tests.

- Commit the changes (including "regexpworker.exe").
